\pard\sa160\b\fs32 Subtitle Converter\b0\fs20\par
\pard\sa160 Subtitle Converter is a lightweight, fully offline desktop tool that converts text subtitle files between SRT, WebVTT, LRC, ASS, SSA and SBV. All processing happens on this computer: the application has no network code and never uploads, collects or transmits your subtitle files.\par
